{"seq":2,"slug":"hazard-risk-scoring-pipeline","title":"危害风险评分、分级研判与召回触发管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/hazard-risk-scoring-pipeline","wordCount":2686,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"危害风险评分-分级研判与召回触发管道\">危害风险评分、分级研判与召回触发管道</h1><p>上游归一化层已把客服工单、评论、平台工单和监管通报折叠成统一 signal 表并聚成信号簇（见 <a href=\"safety-signal-source-taxonomy\">安全信号来源分类、采集与归一化数据模型</a>）。管道走到这里才真正决定一家跨境企业要不要动货：一批锂电充电宝的信号簇，是留在监测水位、进入人工复核，还是直接触发对北美三仓的在途拦截和欧盟 Safety Gate 上报？这套管道的产物不是分数，而是<strong>把加权信号簇确定性地映射成一个可审计的处置等级与动作</strong>——派给谁、在什么时限内、执行什么动作，以及为什么。</p>\n<p>本文聚焦研判与触发这一段。信号如何分类、消解与加权属于上一环节；触发后怎么界定受影响批次与人群，见 <a href=\"../crossborder-recall-execution/recall-scope-affected-population-identification\">召回范围与受影响人群界定</a>；强制与自愿的判定归属，见 <a href=\"../recall-regime-liability-model/mandatory-voluntary-recall-decision-mechanism\">强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-严重度与概率是两个不可互换的轴\">核心概念：严重度与概率是两个不可互换的轴</h2><p>最常见的建模错误是把「危险有多严重」和「发生概率有多大」压进一个分数。这两件事在召回制度里承担完全不同的法律后果：欧盟 GPSR 第 3 条把「严重风险」定义为<strong>需要公共机构快速介入</strong>的风险，判据包含「有害影响并不立即显现」，强调后果的量级与不可逆性；美国 CPSC 的 substantial product hazard 判据（CPSA §15(b)，<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064</a>）同时问缺陷的<strong>模式与规模</strong>与<strong>致害的严重程度</strong>。监管判据本身就是二维的，把它们加成一个标量会丢掉义务成立所依赖的那一维。</p>\n<p>因此评分管道的骨架是一个<strong>风险矩阵（risk matrix）</strong>：横轴危害严重度（severity），纵轴发生可能性（likelihood），交叉格落等级。这与欧盟 Safety Gate 的官方风险评定实践一致——其风险评估指南（Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2019/417 配套的 Risk Assessment Guidelines）先定危险类型，再按危害严重度与暴露概率分级，最后归入 low / medium / high / serious 四档。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[信号簇] --&gt; B[严重度打分&lt;br/&gt;severity]&#10;  A --&gt; C[可能性打分&lt;br/&gt;likelihood]&#10;  B --&gt; D[暴露修正&lt;br/&gt;受影响人群 / 渠道规模]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E{风险矩阵定位}&#10;  E --&gt; F[low&lt;br/&gt;监测]&#10;  E --&gt; G[medium&lt;br/&gt;人工复核]&#10;  E --&gt; H[high&lt;br/&gt;启动调查 / 排查批次]&#10;  E --&gt; I[serious&lt;br/&gt;触发召回评估]&#10;  I --&gt; J[召回触发管道&lt;br/&gt;通知 / 拦截 / 上报]\">graph TD\n  A[信号簇] --&gt; B[严重度打分&lt;br/&gt;severity]\n  A --&gt; C[可能性打分&lt;br/&gt;likelihood]\n  B --&gt; D[暴露修正&lt;br/&gt;受影响人群 / 渠道规模]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E{风险矩阵定位}\n  E --&gt; F[low&lt;br/&gt;监测]\n  E --&gt; G[medium&lt;br/&gt;人工复核]\n  E --&gt; H[high&lt;br/&gt;启动调查 / 排查批次]\n  E --&gt; I[serious&lt;br/&gt;触发召回评估]\n  I --&gt; J[召回触发管道&lt;br/&gt;通知 / 拦截 / 上报]</pre><p>四档的分界不是拍脑袋的常数，而要能<strong>反向解释</strong>：任何一次判定，审计时必须能用当时的输入复现出等级。这就是下一节把严重度拆成可枚举因子、而非让评分函数吃黑箱向量的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"严重度打分-从危险分类法到可解释因子\">严重度打分：从危险分类法到可解释因子</h2><p>严重度的输入首选<strong>受控危险分类</strong>，而非自由文本。上一环节的 crosswalk 已把 CPSC 危险面（fire、burn、choking、ingestion、entrapment、electrocution、strangulation、tip-over 等）和 Safety Gate 风险类别对齐到内部 <code>hazard_code</code>。每类危险有先天的后果上限：choking 与 ingestion 对儿童可能不可逆，burn 通常可逆但需医疗介入，tip-over 对家具类可能致死亡。严重度基线可直接挂在分类上。</p>\n<p>但要处理「同一危险、不同受害群体后果悬殊」，需引入脆弱性修正。一个可解释的因子模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>severity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>hazard</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>vuln</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>revers</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{severity}(c) = \\min\\!\\left(5,\\; s_{\\text{hazard}} \\cdot w_{\\text{vuln}} \\cdot w_{\\text{revers}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">severity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hazard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vuln</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">revers</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>hazard</mtext></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{hazard}} \\in [1,5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hazard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是危险分类基线，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>vuln</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{vuln}} \\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vuln</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是脆弱群体修正（婴幼儿、孕妇、高龄品类取高值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>revers</mtext></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{revers}} \\in \\{1, 1.3, 1.6\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">revers</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 是不可逆性修正（致命或永久损伤取最高档）。取 min 封顶到 5，避免修正项把等级推到没有对应处置语义的区间。</p>\n<p>因子取值必须<strong>版本化存储</strong>：<code>severity_model_version</code> 写进每个评分记录。监管问询「当时为什么判成 serious」时，你能指出用的是 v3 模型、<code>hazard_code=INGEST-SMALL-PART</code>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>vuln</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{vuln}}=1.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vuln</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span></span></span></span></span>，而非「系统算出来的」。这是评分管道区别于评分模型的核心：<strong>可复现性优先于精度</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>危险类别</th>\n<th>后果性质</th>\n<th>基线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>典型召回动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>窒息 / 误吞小部件</td>\n<td>可致命、不可逆</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>立即下架 + 强制召回评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电击 / 起火</td>\n<td>可致命、部分可逆</td>\n<td>4–5</td>\n<td>下架 + 批次排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学超标（铅/邻苯）</td>\n<td>慢性、滞后显现</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>召回 + 长期健康告知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机械割伤 / 夹伤</td>\n<td>可逆、需医疗</td>\n<td>2–3</td>\n<td>整改 + 监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签/警示缺失</td>\n<td>间接风险</td>\n<td>1–2</td>\n<td>补正说明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中的慢性危害（如铅超标）概率上可能低频，但严重度不低——这正是 GPSR 把「有害影响不立即显现」写进严重风险定义的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可能性打分-用暴露量而非直觉估计\">可能性打分：用暴露量而非直觉估计</h2><p>可能性估计的难点在于跨境场景下你<strong>拿不到真实发生率</strong>：一段销量、一批退货、几条评论，分母通常是全球出货量的近似。工程上退一步，用<strong>可观测的暴露代理量</strong>替代真实概率，并让代理量与信号强度共同决定等级。三个可用代理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信号强度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>strength</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{strength}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">strength</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：上一环节算出的信号簇强度，已含权威、通道、时效三维权重。</li>\n<li><strong>受影响规模</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>exposure</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{exposure}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exposure</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：批次出货量或已售数量，跨境常按「目的国 × 批次」聚合。</li>\n<li><strong>缺陷模式趋势</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>trend</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{trend}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trend</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：同一 <code>hazard_code</code> 在时间窗内是否呈上升，趋势比单点数值更能区分系统性缺陷与偶发误用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个把三者合成的可能性评分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>likelihood</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>strength</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>exposure</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>trend</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{likelihood}(c) = \\sigma\\!\\left(\\alpha \\ln \\text{strength}(c) + \\beta \\ln \\text{exposure}(c) + \\gamma \\cdot \\text{trend}(c)\\right), \\quad \\sigma(z)=\\frac{1}{1+e^{-z}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">likelihood</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">strength</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exposure</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trend</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6973em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 把结果压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 便于落进风险矩阵；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 可配置且随品类校准。这里有一个必须显式处理的问题：<strong>用户误用造成的伤害不该抬高缺陷概率</strong>。上一环节的源可靠性跟踪在这里回用——高误报源的信号在进入 <code>strength</code> 前先降权。ISO 10377 与 ISO 10393（消费品安全与召回——供应商指南）都把「缺陷」与「误用」的区分作为风险评估前置动作，工程上对应一个 <code>use_misuse_flag</code>，落入误用通道的信号不参与缺陷可能性评分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级研判-矩阵定位-置信门槛与人机边界\">分级研判：矩阵定位、置信门槛与人机边界</h2><p>两个轴落进矩阵后，矩阵定位只是第一步，决定动作的是<strong>定位 + 置信度 + 法域</strong>的联合。置信度低时，落在 high 也不该直接触发召回，而应落到「加强调查」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[矩阵定位] --&gt; B{置信度 &gt;= 门槛?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[按定位分派动作]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[加采集 / 人工复核]&#10;  D --&gt; A&#10;  C --&gt; E{涉及法域?}&#10;  E --&gt;|欧盟| F[GPSR 严重风险路径]&#10;  E --&gt;|美国| G[CPSA 15 b 路径]&#10;  E --&gt;|中国| H[缺陷产品召回路径]&#10;  F --&gt; I[登记处置记录]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[矩阵定位] --&gt; B{置信度 &gt;= 门槛?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[按定位分派动作]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[加采集 / 人工复核]\n  D --&gt; A\n  C --&gt; E{涉及法域?}\n  E --&gt;|欧盟| F[GPSR 严重风险路径]\n  E --&gt;|美国| G[CPSA 15 b 路径]\n  E --&gt;|中国| H[缺陷产品召回路径]\n  F --&gt; I[登记处置记录]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p><strong>人机边界必须在设计时定死</strong>，不能事后靠「人工抽检」兜底：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自动放行</strong>：low / medium 且置信度达标，直接落监测或派发复核工单，不阻塞。</li>\n<li><strong>人工确权</strong>：high 以上的<strong>动作类</strong>决策（是否启动召回、如何界定范围）必须有人签核。系统可自动建单、拦 listing、冻结批次（可逆），但对外通知、上报监管、公告不可逆。</li>\n<li><strong>升级兜底</strong>：置信度不足但严重度因子达顶（如 ingestion、电击）时，直接进人工队列——<strong>严重度可单独触发人工介入，哪怕可能性证据薄</strong>，防止「因为数据少所以放过去」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>置信门槛按严重度分档：高严重度用低门槛（宁可误报也复核），低严重度用高门槛（避免淹没人工），把误报与漏报成本的非对称显式写进阈值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>置信要求</th>\n<th>可逆动作（自动）</th>\n<th>不可逆动作（人工签核）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>low</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>记录 + 趋势监测</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>medium</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>派发复核工单</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>high</td>\n<td>低–中</td>\n<td>冻结批次、暂停 listing</td>\n<td>启动调查、通知供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>serious</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全面拦截在途 + 预填上报材料</td>\n<td>召回决定、监管上报、公众公告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"召回触发管道-从分级结论到幂等动作编排\">召回触发管道：从分级结论到幂等动作编排</h2><p>分级结论落到管道，管道要把<strong>判定映射为一组带时限、可幂等重放、可审计的动作</strong>。跨境召回不是单一动作，而是并行的若干条：平台下架、仓侧拦截、买家通知、监管上报。这些动作时限不同——欧盟 GPSR 下严重风险需<strong>立即</strong>通知主管机构与消费者，CPSC 侧要求在确定存在 substantial product hazard 后的<strong>24 小时内</strong>报告——所以管道必须<strong>按动作独立推进</strong>，而非等所有动作齐备才启动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[serious / high 判定] --&gt; B[生成召回触发事件]&#10;  B --&gt; C[幂等键&lt;br/&gt;cluster_id + decision_version]&#10;  C --&gt; D1[平台下架动作]&#10;  C --&gt; D2[仓侧批次拦截]&#10;  C --&gt; D3[监管上报任务]&#10;  C --&gt; D4[买家通知编排]&#10;  D1 --&gt; E[动作状态回写]&#10;  D2 --&gt; E&#10;  D3 --&gt; E&#10;  D4 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{全部完成?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[超时升级 / 重试]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[归档处置记录]\">flowchart TD\n  A[serious / high 判定] --&gt; B[生成召回触发事件]\n  B --&gt; C[幂等键&lt;br/&gt;cluster_id + decision_version]\n  C --&gt; D1[平台下架动作]\n  C --&gt; D2[仓侧批次拦截]\n  C --&gt; D3[监管上报任务]\n  C --&gt; D4[买家通知编排]\n  D1 --&gt; E[动作状态回写]\n  D2 --&gt; E\n  D3 --&gt; E\n  D4 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{全部完成?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[超时升级 / 重试]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[归档处置记录]</pre><p>三条不可退让的纪律。第一，<strong>幂等</strong>：触发事件幂等键取 <code>cluster_id + decision_version</code>；同一信号簇因新信号被重新评分会产出新的 <code>decision_version</code>，只有等级<strong>跨过动作阈值</strong>（如 medium→high）时才生成新触发事件，重复评分不重复发通知。第二，<strong>可逆与不可逆分离</strong>：拦截、冻结、下架属可逆，允许自动执行与失败重试；上报、公告、对外通知属不可逆，需人工签核且每个动作单独留痕。第三，<strong>状态回写闭环</strong>：每个动作把真实状态写回处置记录，管道的「已完成」指动作真实完成，不是任务已派发——已被平台驳回的下架不能算召回完成。</p>\n<p>每条处置记录要能回答：输入是哪个信号簇、用了哪个模型版本、两轴分值与矩阵位置、置信度多少、谁签核了什么。这份<strong>决策日志</strong>同时服务三件事——内部复盘校准权重、向监管证明尽到注意义务、日后同一批货再出现信号时比对历史。没有它，评分管道就是黑箱，而在召回监管场景里黑箱等于没有证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>两轴不可合并</strong>：严重度与可能性分别对应监管判据的不同构件，压成标量会丢掉义务成立所依赖的维度。</li>\n<li><strong>严重度挂分类法</strong>：基线取自 <code>hazard_code</code>，脆弱性与不可逆性做可解释修正，因子取值随模型版本存档。</li>\n<li><strong>可能性用暴露代理</strong>：信号强度、受影响规模、缺陷趋势合成，误用通道单列不参与缺陷评分（ISO 10377 前置）。</li>\n<li><strong>矩阵定位不等于动作</strong>：置信门槛按严重度分档，高严重度可单独触发人工介入，漏报成本高于误报成本。</li>\n<li><strong>人机边界前置</strong>：可逆动作自动执行，不可逆动作（对外通知、上报、公告）必须人工签核。</li>\n<li><strong>管道幂等且可审计</strong>：<code>cluster_id + decision_version</code> 防重复触发，动作状态真实回写，决策日志是核心产出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主要来源：欧盟 GPSR（Regulation (EU) 2023/988，第 3、24 条，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/988/oj\">EUR-Lex</a>）及其风险评估指南（Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2019/417）；美国 CPSA §15(b)（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064</a>，24 小时报告义务参照 16 CFR Part 1115）；中国《消费品召回管理暂行规定》（市场监管总局令第 22 号）；ISO 10377:2013 与 ISO 10393:2013。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"危害风险评分、分级研判与召回触发管道","id":"危害风险评分-分级研判与召回触发管道"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：严重度与概率是两个不可互换的轴","id":"核心概念-严重度与概率是两个不可互换的轴"},{"level":2,"text":"严重度打分：从危险分类法到可解释因子","id":"严重度打分-从危险分类法到可解释因子"},{"level":2,"text":"可能性打分：用暴露量而非直觉估计","id":"可能性打分-用暴露量而非直觉估计"},{"level":2,"text":"分级研判：矩阵定位、置信门槛与人机边界","id":"分级研判-矩阵定位-置信门槛与人机边界"},{"level":2,"text":"召回触发管道：从分级结论到幂等动作编排","id":"召回触发管道-从分级结论到幂等动作编排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"安全信号来源分类、采集与归一化数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/safety-signal-source-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"批次溯源谱系建模与受影响范围影响面查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/traceability-batch-genealogy-query"}}